									The Rathe Games - 
									9/28/2004 12:00:00 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><font color="#0000ff" size="6"><strong><img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" />&nbsp; <img src="/pics/1602/upcomingevents.jpg" />&nbsp; <img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" /><br /><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1555"><img src="/pics/1602/RatheGamesLogo.JPG" />&nbsp;<br /></a></strong></font><br /><font color="#0000ff">Sunday, October the 10th, at 8pm cst, the Rathe Games will begin.&nbsp; These games will be much like the old Seru Games, but they'll take place in Lake Rathetear, and The Arena.&nbsp; Invite your friends, your foes, your aquantices, and potential members to meet us in Lake Rathetear at 8pm cst.&nbsp; Some of the rules have changed slightly, click the picture above to see what the Rathe Games are, and all the rules.</font><br /><br /><img src="/pics/1602/Amy.jpg" /></p>
								</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
		<td>
