							</td>
	</tr><tr>
		<td align="Center">
								<p class="newsTitle">
									The Hole - 
									9/25/2004 2:40:00 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" /><font face="Bradley Hand ITC" color="#ffa500" size="6"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src="/pics/1602/previousraids.jpg" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" /><br /><font color="#ee82ee">The Hole<br /><img src="/pics/1602/Raids/Echo1.jpg" /><br /></font><font color="#0000ff" size="4"><font size="2"><br />Well, ok, so we wiped.&nbsp; It was a new mob to us though.&nbsp; A wipe is no big deal.&nbsp; We reformed, and took down that nasty Echo.&nbsp; Woot!!!&nbsp; <br /><br /></font><img src="/pics/1602/Raids/EchoBird.jpg" /><br /><br /><img src="/pics/1602/Raids/DEAD%21.jpg" /><br /><font size="2"><br />My internet let us down though, and we couldn't get the guardian of seal, but we will.</font>&nbsp; <br /></font></strong></font></p><font face="Bradley Hand ITC" color="#ffa500" size="6"><strong><font color="#0000ff" size="4"> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/Raids/GoS.jpg" /></p> <p align="center">What was I proud of?&nbsp; I was proud that we all stuck around, and kept trying til we got it.&nbsp; We all knew basically what we were supposed to do, and we did it.&nbsp; We rocked!&nbsp; What do we need to work on?&nbsp; Patience =)<br /><img src="/pics/1602/Raids/LinkDeath.jpg" /><br /><br /><img src="/pics/1602/Amy.jpg" /></p></font></strong></font>
								</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
